  "title": "Soft and Chewy Oatmeal Raisin Cookies",
  "description": "These oatmeal raisin cookies are made with canola oil instead of butter for a soft, chewy, and tender texture. Perfect for a sweet treat!",
  "authors": [
    "Cal Schroeck"
  ],
